Let me think about how the flow checker reasons. Reading env("API_SECRET") produces secret-tainted data. Taint flows to `values.apiSecret`, then to `apiSecret`, then to the comparison `apiSecret === undefined`. Comparisons don't leak. Then branch returns. So where does secret reach the body?

